cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this replication package, please cite the technical report it
  accompanies.
title: >-
  Replication package: Do Stack Overflow Answer Edits Occur Beyond Java?
  A Replication on Python and JavaScript
abstract: >-
  Data, code and intermediate results for a replication, on Python and JavaScript, of the
  Java study of Stack Overflow answer edits by Wiratsin et al. (arXiv:2511.05813).
  Includes the SOTorrent extraction and analysis pipeline, the Levenshtein edit-distance
  data for 637,923 Python and 793,362 JavaScript code-block revision pairs, and the
  clone-search results for 100 GitHub projects per language. The technical report itself
  is distributed separately.
